#: .././io/encrypt.c:197
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" display the encryption policy of the current file\n"
"\n"
" -1 -- Use only the old ioctl to get the encryption policy.\n"
"       This only works if the file has a v1 encryption policy.\n"
" -t -- Test whether v2 encryption policies are supported.\n"
"       Prints \"supported\", \"unsupported\", or an error message.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" visa krypteringspolicyn för den aktuella filen\n"
"\n"
" -1 -- Använd bara den gamla ioctl för att hämta krypteringspolicyn.\n"
"       Detta fungerar bara om filen har en v1-krypteringspolicy.\n"
" -t -- Testa om v2-krypteringspolicyer stöds.\n"
"       Skriver ut \"stöds\", \"stöds inte\" eller ett felmeddelande.\n"
"\n"

#: .././io/encrypt.c:213
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" assign an encryption policy to the currently open file\n"
"\n"
" Examples:\n"
" 'set_encpolicy' - assign v1 policy with default key descriptor\n"
"                   (0000000000000000)\n"
" 'set_encpolicy -v 2' - assign v2 policy with default key identifier\n"
"                        (00000000000000000000000000000000)\n"
" 'set_encpolicy 0000111122223333' - assign v1 policy with given key descriptor\n"
" 'set_encpolicy 00001111222233334444555566667777' - assign v2 policy with given\n"
"                                                    key identifier\n"
"\n"
" -c MODE -- contents encryption mode\n"
" -n MODE -- filenames encryption mode\n"
" -f FLAGS -- policy flags\n"
" -s LOG2_DUSIZE -- log2 of data unit size\n"
" -v VERSION -- policy version\n"
"\n"
" MODE can be numeric or one of the following predefined values:\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" tilldela en krypteringspolicy till den aktuella öppna filen\n"
"\n"
" Exempel:\n"
" \"set_encpolicy\" - tilldela v1-policy med standardnyckelbeskrivare\n"
"                   (0000000000000000)\n"
" \"set_encpolicy -v 2\" - tilldela v2-policy med standardnyckelidentifierare\n"
"                        (00000000000000000000000000000000)\n"
" 'set_encpolicy 0000111122223333' - Tilldela v1-policy med angiven nyckelbeskrivare\n"
" \"set_encpolicy 00001111222233334444555566667777\" - tilldela v2-policy med angiven\n"
"                                                    nyckelidentifierare\n"
"\n"
" -c MODE -- krypteringsläge för innehåll\n"
" -n MODE -- krypteringsläge för filnamn\n"
" -f FLAGS -- policyflaggor\n"
" -s LOG2_DUSIZE -- log2 av storleken på dataenheten\n"
" -v VERSION -- version av policyn\n"
"\n"
" MODE kan vara numeriskt eller ett av följande fördefinierade värden:\n"

#: .././io/encrypt.c:240
#, c-format
msgid ""
" FLAGS and VERSION must be numeric.\n"
"\n"
" Note that it's only possible to set an encryption policy on an empty\n"
" directory.  It's then inherited by new files and subdirectories.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" FLAGS och VERSION måste vara numeriska.\n"
"\n"
" Observera att en krypteringspolicy bara kan anges för en tom\n"
" katalog. Den ärvs sedan av nya filer och underkataloger.\n"
"\n"

#: .././io/encrypt.c:251
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" add an encryption key to the filesystem\n"
"\n"
" Examples:\n"
" 'add_enckey' - add key for v2 policies\n"
" 'add_enckey -d 0000111122223333' - add key for v1 policies w/ given descriptor\n"
"\n"
"Unless -k is given, the key in binary is read from standard input.\n"
" -d DESCRIPTOR -- master_key_descriptor\n"
" -k KEY_ID -- ID of fscrypt-provisioning key containing the raw key\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" lägg till en krypteringsnyckel i filsystemet\n"
"\n"
" Exempel:\n"
" 'add_enckey' - lägg till nyckel för v2-policyer\n"
" 'add_enckey -d 0000111122223333' - lägg till nyckel för v1-policyer med angiven deskriptor\n"
"\n"
"Om inte -k anges läses nyckeln binärt från standardinmatningen.\n"
" -d DESCRIPTOR -- master_key_descriptor\n"
" -k KEY_ID -- ID för fscrypt-provisioneringsnyckeln som innehåller den råa nyckeln\n"
"\n"

#: .././io/encrypt.c:268
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
" remove an encryption key from the filesystem\n"
"\n"
" Examples:\n"
" 'rm_enckey 0000111122223333' - remove key for v1 policies w/ given descriptor\n"
" 'rm_enckey 00001111222233334444555566667777' - remove key for v2 policies w/ given identifier\n"
"\n"
" -a -- remove key for all users who have added it (privileged operation)\n"
